A '''house''' was located on [[Niamos]].<ref name="Ann">{{Andor|Announcement}}</ref> In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{AndorDate|107}}</ref> [[Cassian Jeron Andor]] under the alias of Keef Girgo was living here with his girlfriend [[Windi]]. Later in that year however, he was arrested by a [[Coastal defender stormtrooper]] and was falsely charged for "Civil disruption, anti- Imperial speech, fleeing the scene of anti- Imperial activity, attempted damage to Imperial property."<ref name="Ann" />

